# CODEOWNERS for krconnects-ecommerce
#
# Who must review changes to which files.
# GitHub automatically requests a review from the owner when a PR changes a matching path.
#
# Rules:
#   - Format:  <path pattern>  <owner(s)>
#   - The LAST matching line wins, so the general rule goes first and specific rules go below it.
#   - Owners are GitHub users (@user) or, in an organization, teams (@org/team-name).
#
# This is a personal repo, so every owner is @krishnareddydotnet.
# The comment above each block shows the team that would own it in an enterprise organization.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner: anything not matched below
# Enterprise: @krconnects/platform-team
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*                               @krishnareddydotnet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Application services (each service team owns its own code)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Enterprise: @krconnects/dotnet-team
/auth-api/                      @krishnareddydotnet
/data-api/                      @krishnareddydotnet

# Enterprise: @krconnects/java-team
/catalog-api/                   @krishnareddydotnet

# Enterprise: @krconnects/frontend-team
/customer-portal/               @krishnareddydotnet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployment and pipelines (platform / DevSecOps team)
# A change here can deploy to production or leak secrets, so it needs an expert review.
# Enterprise: @krconnects/devsecops-team
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/helm/                          @krishnareddydotnet
/.github/workflows/             @krishnareddydotnet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Security-sensitive files (security team)
# Nobody can quietly allow-list a secret, weaken the pre-commit hook
# or change who owns what without a security review.
# Enterprise: @krconnects/security-team
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/.gitleaksignore                @krishnareddydotnet
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @krishnareddydotnet
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @krishnareddydotnet
/docs/runbooks/                 @krishnareddydotnet
